  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IBON Civil Soc and Accra</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IBON Civila samh &amp; Accra</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has been approached by OECD/DCD WP EFF Advisory Group on Civil Society and the Philippine based international NGO IBON to support a multi-stakeholder dialogue with the civil society towards the High Level Forum in Accra, Ghana 2008. The dialogue involves national and international CSOs from the North and the South, Official donor agencies, multilateral organisations as well as Northern and Southern</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till dialogen om civila samh&#xe4;llet och Parisagendan genom a) f&#xf6;rberedelser inf&#xf6;r nationella konsultationer i ett antal (h&#xf6;gst 15) l&#xe4;nder i syd, b) regionala konsultationer koordinerade av OECD/DAC WP EFF Advisory Group on civil society and aid effectiveness och c) st&#xf6;d till deltagare i syds deltagande i en parallellkonferens i samband med Accra-m&#xf6;tet 2008.</narrative>
  </description>
